OL,3,ASuspects hunted after police officer
OL,4,Ainjured in shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetectives are searching for two
OL,7,Fsuspects who fled after a police
OL,8,Fofficer was shot in Nottingham city
OL,9,Fcentre.
OL,11,FNottinghamshire Police said the officer
OL,12,Fhad approached two suspects in Angel
OL,13,FRow shortly before 04:50 BST on Sunday.
OL,15,FThe officer is in a stable condition in
OL,16,Fhospital, where he is receiving
OL,17,Ftreatment for a wound to his foot, the
OL,18,Fforce added.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/38
